--- !u!1 &907777323
GameObject:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  serializedVersion: 6
  m_Component:
  - component: {fileID: 907777324}
  - component: {fileID: 907777326}
  - component: {fileID: 907777325}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: 'FIELD MANUAL


    Left-click / drag: select    Shift: add selection

    Right-click:
    move, attack, gather or set a producer''s rally point

    F then click: attack-move   
    Q E R T G Z X V B: popup actions in order

    Ctrl+1-9: store group    1-9:
    recall group    F1-F4: commander powers

    WASD / arrows: camera    Wheel:
    zoom    C: focus    Home: HQ

    Minimap: click to look, right-click to move   
    Space: last alert

    I: next idle worker    Click objects: inspect / actions

    Esc
    / right-click: cancel targeting    Esc: pause


    SUPPLY  Workers cost 1, soldiers
    cost 2. HQ and barracks

    provide some; build supply relays for more.


    ARMOR 
    Soldiers beat Light and Medium, struggle with Heavy.

    Turrets crush Heavy
    but barely scratch Light. Read the next

    wave preview and build the answer
    before it arrives.


    HOSTILES  Runners hunt your workers, brutes and juggernauts

    siege
    your structures, standard hostiles march on HQ.

    Lancers shoot from range,
    breakers are built to smash a

    defender screen, and wardens mend the wave
    until you kill

    them. Click any hostile to read what answers it.'
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
